## for CI pipeline
# contents for githubactions
1. app.py 
2. .github/workflows/run.yml    ##can be found in githubactions->workflows
3. requirements.txt

# if u want to test app.py before uploading
4. test_app.py   #test_*.py is necessary, * can be anything
5. contents of test_app.py : def test_processimage(), def test_main(), assert is used to check if functionality is correct
6. add pytest in requirements if test_app.py file is added 

## for CD pipeline
7. Add dockerfile
8. modify corresponding yml if deployment is to be added     ##can be found in githubactions->workflows
9. add aws/dockerhub username/password

project/
├── your_script.py
├── test_main.py                 
├── utils/
│   ├── image_utils.py
│   └── app_utils.py      
└── tests/
│   ├── test_image_utils.py
│   └── test_app_utils.py      
├── Dockerfile